{"product_id":"your-show","title":"Your Show","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"'It's a double celebration tonight, not that many will care about your special role. You carry the weight of the occasion on your shoulders, take it in your stride. You've worked hard to get here, earned these palpitations. You, the first black man to referee in the Premiership.' From Jamaica to Sheffield to the recently formed Premier League, Uri rises through the ranks as a referee, making it to the select group list, the highest level of our national game. But along the way he is confronted with the tensions and prejudices, old and new, which emerge as his every move is watched, analysed and commented on. Your Show is an extraordinary novel which charts one black man's pioneering efforts to make it, against the odds, to the very top of his profession and beyond.\"--Provided by publisher.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ashley Hickson-Lovence\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780571366798\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885701259417,"sku":"13RG9780571366798","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69145190315cd_Your_show.jpg?v=1762965077","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/your-show","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}